# The protocol's edges: a request before `initialize`; a byte order mark,
# a lone `\r` and a `\r\n`, after which every position keeps its place
# (the byte order mark is not Tally, so the parse fails there); and the
# diagnostics of a file the program reads but no editor opened, published
# and then cleared.
hover main.tally 1:1
initialize
open odd.tally
tokens odd.tally
close odd.tally
open app.tally
change app.tally
| let n = 1
save app.tally
# A rename to a name that is not one token, or not a name.
open main.tally
rename main.tally 8:9 9x
rename main.tally 8:9 fn
close main.tally
# `exit` before `shutdown`.
exit
